# ── Credentials and state. Never commit this. ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# `.state/` holds the WeChat bot token, the `get_updates_buf` cursor, the per-peer context tokens and
# the fetched QR image. It also holds `_refs/`, which is reference material downloaded from *other*
# projects (the iLink protocol docs and DSH's own READMEs and source excerpts) — republishing that
# under this repository's name would be a licensing problem on top of a credential leak.
#
# Both live under this one path, so this single line covers both. Do not use `git add -f` here.
.state/

# ── Packaging output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip
node_modules/

# ── OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
